{"id":"vod_sn_36356","vodId":"36356","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔高校D×D第二季","name_cn":"恶魔高校D×D第二季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/be3e9c3bc5b33d499a87d016d4603dc2.jpg"},"summary":"兵藤一诚（梶裕贵 饰）是学校里出了名的好色男，因此遭到了诸多女生的嫌恶，某日，一位名叫天野夕麻（生天目仁美 配音）的神秘美少女突然出在了一诚的面前，她不仅向一诚告了白，还提出了约会的请求。难道一诚的春天就要这样来临了？　　让一诚没有想到的是，在初次的约会之中，自己竟然被天野夕麻杀死了。原来，夕麻的真实身份是下级堕天使丽娜丽，她接受了教会的命令，专门前来刺杀一诚。就在一诚魂飞魄散之际，学园里的公认校花莉亚丝（日笠阳子 配音）出现在了他的面前，她使用恶魔棋子将一诚复活，并使其成为了自己的眷属。教会刺杀一诚的真实目的究竟是什么呢？一诚又将怎样面对死而复生的人生呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gc1xwBEyg51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R1TK0Z9C3t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/60HngVb8zt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2zdKfvcfwu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c3QZ9US9tG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9n92K0LShQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u6ELdkZs401/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fjsu54j11N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f12W7S3Kna1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UpHwWsP4kH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9PbKpuTrRA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FYhfU7N0X91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iTcp24mHmL1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:23.537Z"}